No, the notochord is epiblastic and at the stage where it closes, it takes hypoblastic information with it.

24
00:02:33.342 --> 00:02:35.502
It is essentially epiblastic.

25
00:02:40.202 --> 00:02:48.552
Do you understand? It is epiblastic due to all this movement and when it becomes chordal, thus only a cord, it has information.

26
